<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For you shall go out in joy,</l><l>And be led forth in peace.</l><l>The mountains and hills before you shall sing,</l><l>And the trees of the fields clap their hands.</l><l>Instead of the thorns shall come cypress,</l><l>And myrtle replace every brier,</l><l>And it shall be to remember the Lord,</l><l>And everlasting sign.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
